-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
copper-rs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This work started as a port of `examples/cu_human_pose` from copper-rs
(https://github.com/copper-project/copper-rs), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The example app's `GstToCuImage` task and its
Rerun view descend from that example's tasks, and the detection task follows
the structure of its pose task.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Candle
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`crates/cu-skylock-detect/src/yolo/model.rs` is adapted from the yolo-v8
example of Candle
(https://github.com/huggingface/candle/tree/main/candle-examples/examples/yolo-v8),
by way of copper-rs's `examples/cu_human_pose`. Candle is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, or the MIT license, at your option.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
YOLOv8 weights
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are part of this repository. At run time the detection task
downloads `yolov8*.safetensors` from `lmz/candle-yolo-v8` on Hugging Face.
Ultralytics publishes the YOLOv8 models under AGPL-3.0, with an Enterprise
licence as the alternative; that licence, not this repository's, covers the
weights.
